SUMMARY:First Friday in Downtown Lancaster City
DESCRIPTION:Each and every first Friday of the month\, Lancaster City celebrates its fabulous arts community with new gallery openings\, special events\, and live performances\, and more. Shops and restaurants often extend their hours and host unique promotions as well. \nSee the City come alive on First Friday! \nEvent Calendar for Lancaster\, PA »\n(click here) \n\nCheck below for a calendar of the upcoming Friday events:\n\nFirst Fridays in Lancaster City\nFirst Friday in Mt. Gretna\nFirst Saturday in Ephrata\nThird Fridays are Music Fridays in Lancaster\nFourth Friday in Columbia\nFourth Friday in Mount Joy\n\nSee our monthly Calendar of Friday Events for descriptions of each. \n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
