CREATED:20260402T152815Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260429T184156Z
UID:10000013-1777723200-1777744800@stevensandsmithcenter.org
SUMMARY:Community Block Party for History
DESCRIPTION:Community Block Party for History\n\n\n\nThe Stevens & Smith Center Grand Opening takes over East Vine Street for a buzzing community block party on Saturday\, May 2 from 12-6pm! \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLocal artists\, musicians\, and neighbors bring the streets to life with creativity\, energy\, and good vibes. Families and friends can dive into hands-on activities and enjoy free timed entry to explore the Center. \n\n\n\nFree & open to the public. All are welcome! \n\n\n\n——————————————————————— \n\n\n\nThe Community Block Party for History takes place on Saturday\, May 2 from 12-6pm on East Vine Street between South Queen and Christian Streets in Lancaster City. The Block Party is free and open to the public. \n\n\n\nClick here to view what vendors are coming to the Block Party! \n\n\n\nWe’re also excited to welcome the following food trucks into our Food Truck Village: Decades; Hello Mango Bakery; Mezcla Ice Cream; Nano Burger; Raney Cellars; Scott’s Artisan Pizza; Souvlaki Boys; and Vine Bar.  \n\n\n\nCheck out our entertainment lineup\, supported by DJ Edge and MC Hamilton Newton! \n\n\n\n——————————————————————— \n\n\n\nOn Saturday\, May 2\, the community is invited into the Stevens & Smith Center for free\, timed admission!  \n\n\n\nAdmission times at the top of the hour and every half hour are available to reserve online in advance. Admission times every quarter hour will be available at the door\, first come\, first served. \n\n\n\nTimed tickets are now available! Click here to reserve online in advance. \n\n\n\n\nThank You to Our Grand Opening Weekend Presenting Sponsors!
URL:https://stevensandsmithcenter.org/event/community-block-party-for-history/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://stevensandsmithcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/arrives-at-16.avif
END:VEVENT
