SUMMARY:"April" Movie Night!  (May 2nd lol)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nThird month in a row\, movie ni
 ght is bumped from usual last Saturday of the month\, to first available w
 eekend night of the following month!\n\nI intend to show the 2006 document
 ary:\n\nJesus Camp\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QBxATt-sP7Q\
 n\nOther film options that the group can select from will be:\n\nMarjoe\n-
 Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ui7Pz4blum0\n\nDownfall\n-Trailer
 - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2XiY1ldtWVU\n\nBattle of Algiers\n-Trail
 er- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vhhoS3zOskE\n\nAnd many\, many more! B
 ring your own film selections and we may decide to show them!\n\nAdmission
  is Free! Bring as many family members and friends as you would like! Plea
 se RSVP! Discussion after the movie(s)\, hang out and share your thoughts!
 \n\nSome drinks and snacks will be provided\, please do bring more to shar
 e!\nPizza will be ordered\, please do chip in if you partake in delivered 
 food!\n\nSaturday\, May 2nd\, 6:00pm - 10:00pm\nOther Room Theater\n715 N.
  Pine St.\nLancaster PA 17603\n\nWe can delay starting the movie to give p
 eople time to arrive\, but no later than 6:30pm\, please try to arrive bef
 ore then if you do not want to miss any of the movie.\n\nPICTURED below is
  the main entrance\, the event space is right up the stairs. On street par
 king should be available\, several public parking lots such as behind CVS 
 are within a 2 blocks walk along Harrisburg Pike.
