 :30am and another session at 10:30am)Welcome to Family Story Time at the M
 anheim Community Library!You will find us in the Breakout Room of the Krei
 der Farms Cultural Center. Please join us for stories\, crafts\, and activ
 ities!This program contains crafts that may be difficult for babies/toddle
 rs\, but we encourage you to try it! They may surprise you. We attempt new
  motor skills often and encourage parents to help or step back as much as 
 they are comfortable.Family Story Time is a multiple registration type. Pl
 ease register for any day you plan to attend. All (and only) children shou
 ld be registered. This gives me an idea of how many chairs/tables\, as wel
 l as supplies. Drop-offs will not be permitted\, and registration is requi
 red. If you realize you can't make it to Story Time\, please inform Esther
  Martin by emailing her at emartin@manheimlibrary.org. You can also call t
 he front desk at (717)665-6700 Ext. 4200. Please let us know as soon as yo
 u can because we often have a waitlist\, and we want everyone to get the c
 hance to participate if possible.
