X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/baby-time-spring-series-168942"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/baby-time-spring-series-168937"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Baby Time @ THE FARM!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260508T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260508T101500
UID:e660c49b87f86d34b531b5957bdb4fe5@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Discussion\, Music\, Storytime\, Babies\n\nThis Ba
 by time will be outdoors at the farm!Come to the Pleasant View Farm just u
 p the street from the library! Come early to park and walk for this outdoo
 r adventure! (May 8th @ 9:30am and another session at 10:30am)Come wiggle\
 , giggle\, and grow with Miss Esther! Join us for 30 minutes of musical ma
 gic and sweet stories designed especially for your littlest sprouts. We’
 ll be gathered in the meeting room—just a hop\, skip\, and a jump across
  from the circulation desk.This cozy circle is tailor-made for tiny explor
 ers ages 6 to 24 months. Because we want to keep things comfy for everyone
 \, please only register your little ones in this age range. This is a spec
 ial bonding time for you and your baby\, so grown-ups must stay for all th
 e fun—no drop-offs\, please!Is your little one blooming into a big kid? 
 Once they hit their 2nd birthday (past 24 months)\, they’re ready to joi
 n the adventure at Family Story Time! Join us there every Tuesday at 9:30 
 or 10:30 for even more library fun.A quick favor: If your plans change and
  you can't make it\, please let us know so another little friend can join 
 the circle as this class is usually booked up fast!
LOCATION:Manheim Community\, MAN Meeting Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/baby-time-spring-series-
 168937
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
