DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Babies\n\nBook Babies is a special time for babies
  to share stories\, songs\, rhymes and games with their grown-ups. Come pl
 ay with us in the Children’s Library! (Newborn to 17 months\, with adult
 ) Please add any additional registrants to your registration if more than 
 one child that will be participating in the program.Registration for Book 
 Babies will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, May 6th for Manheim Township and
  East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, May 8th for residents of other mu
 nicipalities.Storytime PoliciesProgram Limits - Patrons are limited to one
  session of multiple session programs per week.Cancellations- Please check
  your email prior to departing to verify that the program has not been can
 celled.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more t
 han 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from registering for 
 future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your reg
 istrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for
  those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration 
 status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of th
 e program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will b
 egin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be for
 feited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remai
 n\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants wil
 l not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.
