BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Mickeysblackbox": "https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/philly-drag-mafia-presents-divas-live-at-mickeys/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:mickeysblackbox
X-SOURCE:Mickey's Black Box
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260515T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260515T220000
DTSTAMP:20260501T232138
CREATED:20260208T150008Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260219T061132Z
UID:10000765-1778871600-1778882400@mickeysblackbox.com
SUMMARY:Philly Drag Mafia Presents: Divas Live at Mickey's
DESCRIPTION:Friday May 15th\, 2026\nDoors | 7:00 PM\nShow | 8:00 PM \nReserved Table Seating | $43.60 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nPlease note this event is 21+ – Valid ID Required to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n—————————————————\nPresented by Mickey’s Black Box\n—————————————————\nBrittany Lynn is celebrating her 30th anniversary of performing in 2026-leading the Philadelphia and the tri-state area’s most award winning drag troupe-the Philly Drag Mafia. Brittany works closely with the city of Philadelphia\, and in doing so\, has been awarded two citations from the City Council of Philadelphia-and one from the Mayor-for her work in bridging the gap between Philadelphia’s communities. \nFor her work with her Drag Queen Story time Program\, and her drag brunches and drag bingo events\, Brittany won Best of Philly 2022 and 2023 for Best Drag Shows and Best Drag Brunches. Brittany was named one of the “Top 100 Most Influential People of Philadelphia” in 2023 by Philadelphia Magazine\, and then in 2024\, Brittany was named one of the Philly Phifty-The Top 50 Most Iconic Things About Philly in the Last 50 Years.  \nIn 2024\, Brittany Lynn landed a Guiness Book of World Records Award for Most Attendees at a Drag Story Time Reading\, held at the Constitution Center on June 1st to kick off Pride Month. In 2025\, Brittany was named one of the Top 49 LGBTQIA+ Leaders of Philadelphia by the Philadelphia Gay News.  \nBrittany can be seen in various commercials for Philadelphia tourism with Visit Philadelphia\, Philly’s Official Tourism and Visitor Information website. Catch her adventures and upcoming events at PhillyDragMafia.com.\n—————————————————\n*Ticket Alert*  \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers.  Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets.  Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/philly-drag-mafia-presents-divas-live-at-mickeys/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/01/original-2087DAB3-6BBF-4D63-8A95-F6EE88A04821-e1771481484800.png
END:VEVENT
