 \, Seniors\, Everyone\n\nOpen to all ages. This exhibit will run through J
 une 12.We welcome this exhibit from the Octoraro Art Association. The OAA 
 was founded in 1948 by local\, world-renowned artist Charles X. Carlson an
 d Oxford businessman John W. Roberts. Their objective was to enhance the c
 ulture of the Oxford area through exhibits\, art workshops\, and classes.T
 he Octoraro Art Association continues its mission to this day. They are a 
 group of painters and potters who gather together sharing ideas and inspir
 ation. They meet Thursdays from 1-3 pm at 5965 Forge Road in Oxford PA.
