 sauce\, cheese\, and pepperoni will be available. Participants are welcome
  to bring their own sauce and additional toppings. Cost is $20.00 per pers
 on to cover supplies. If you'd like to make two pizzas\, the cost is $25.0
 0 for two pizzas. Payment via CashApp\, Cash\, or Venmo is accepted the da
 y of the event. Participants must pay prior to receiving their supplies. L
