UID:48e4e4805ba62a37c13582d17b530b00@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nThis isn't your
  grandfather's hobby! 👴Metal detecting has evolved\, and we're here to 
 show you how to do it the right way. Join local metal detectorists from th
 e Lancaster Research and Recovery Club as we dive into the art of saving h
 istory through responsible detecting. 🏛️📜What you'll learn:Gear & 
 Tech: 🎧 Understanding the modern equipment that sees what others miss. 
 🔍The Hunt: 🗺️ How to conduct research to find the best historical 
 spots.Mastering Technique: 🦾 Proper swinging and recovery methods.The C
 ode: 🤝 Essential etiquette to ensure the hobby stays respected and sust
 ainable.With the right info (and a little bit of luck! 🍀)\, you'll be r
 eady to start your own adventure. Let's get digging! 💎🏺
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center B
