BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/sensory-discovery-storytime-160169"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Sensory Discovery Storytime
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260520T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260520T150000
UID:40732622fd6b48158dea10cb67840914@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Children\n\nJoin Ms. Laura for a fun and engaging 
 sensory discovery storytime program all about GARDENS AND DIRT! We will us
 e our senses to explore seeds\, plants and dirt. This program is intended 
 for children 3-6 years old. Children should be able to listen to\, compreh
 end and participate in emergent science\, math and literacy topics. Activi
 ties may include small parts so children should be past the stage of mouth
 ing items. Parents and caregivers are invited to participate with their ch
 ildren to learn how to replicate the activities at home! Sensory experienc
 es provide children with opportunities to develop fine motor skills\, eye-
 hand coordination\, problem solving\, logic and concentration. They'll gro
 w their attention spans and practice emotional regulation and mindfulness.
 Allergy notice: Please note sensory materials may contain allergens like s
 eeds and other natural materials.Ms. Laura has over 20 years of preschool 
 classroom experience bringing a wealth of knowledge in early childhood dev
 elopment. Her approach focuses on creating a warm\, engaging\, and support
 ive environment where children can thrive.Adults attending with their chil
 d(ren) do NOT need to register. Please add any additional registrants to y
 our registration if more than one child that will be participating in the 
 program.Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, May 6th for Manhei
 m Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, May 8th for residen
 ts of other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing t
 o cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a month wi
 ll be restricted from registering for future programs for a period of one 
 month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to
  the start of the program to allow for those on the waiting list to be not
 ified of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arri
 ve 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and o
 ther circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated time
 . At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who
  will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into 
 the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the prog
 ram 5 minutes past the start time.Accompanying Adults – This program is 
 for adults and children to enjoy together. Please plan to attend and be en
 gaged with your child. Drop offs will not be permitted.Cancellations- Plea
 se check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has not 
 been cancelled.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center AB
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/sensory-discovery-storyt
 ime-160169
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
