DESCRIPTION:Community\, Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nLancaster Publi
 c Library is excited to present ASL Storytime! Join Deaf presenter Suzette
  from Language Access PA for stories\, movement\, and activities.  The pro
 gram will be in ASL only\, there will be no translation.Walk-ins welcome
LOCATION:Lancaster\, LPL Program Room A + B
