BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/reserved-program-173614"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Stone by Stone: The Art of World Building with Megan O'Russell
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260526T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260526T200000
UID:9bca633299912b25590bd8a9ad6522de@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Discussion\, Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nJoin author Me
 gan O'Russell to discover the hidden connections that make fictional world
 s feel real! 🌌Ever wondered how labor laws affect dragon-slaying econom
 ies? 🐉⚖️ Or how the fertility of the land affects the weight of a s
 oldier's sword? 🌾⚔️Grab your blueprints! 📜 We’re tearing down 
 flimsy tropes and building original fantasy realms with real depth. Master
  the alchemy of history\, geography\, and social structures to make your f
 ictional world seamless and immersive. 🧪🗺️Whether you are writing 
 a novel or running a tabletop campaign\, you'll learn how to construct an 
 original fantasy realm with logic\, depth\, and seamless continuity. 📖
 🎲✨
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center B
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/reserved-program-173614
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
