X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Mickeysblackbox": "https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/the-eras-of-taylor-a-tribute-to-taylor-swift/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:mickeysblackbox
X-SOURCE:Mickey's Black Box
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260530T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260530T203000
DTSTAMP:20260501T232138
CREATED:20260202T150114Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260214T041443Z
UID:10000774-1780164000-1780173000@mickeysblackbox.com
SUMMARY:The Eras of Taylor: A Tribute to Taylor Swift
DESCRIPTION:Saturday May 30th\, 2026\nDoors | 6:00 PM\nShow | 7:00 PM \nGeneral Admission Standing Room | $60.09 + Fees\nReserved Mezzanine & Balcony Seating | $70.34 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n—————————————————\nPresented by Shenny Enterprises\n—————————————————\nSouth Central Pennsylvania Swifties\, get ready for an unforgettable night with Christina Shaws electrifying Taylor Swift tribute! On Friday\, May 30\, 2026 -The Eras of Taylor- is at Mickeys Black Box! \nWith her roots in Philadelphia and her professional home in Las Vegas\, Christina shines bright with her 90 min Taylor Swift tribute show that embodies the spirit of creativity and passion. -The Eras of Taylor- is a legendary celebration of the music and magic of Taylor Swift\, joined by a dynamic live band! With 25 songs and 11 iconic costumes\, the show provides a memorable experience that emulates the quality and energy of Taylors tour\, leaving a lasting impact on all who experience it!  \nCheck out A Tribute to Taylor Swift here!\n—————————————————\n*Ticket Alert*  \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers.  Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets.  Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/the-eras-of-taylor-a-tribute-to-taylor-swift/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/02/TheErasofTaylor-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
