BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/teen-sleuths-secret-dr-gravelys-retreat-175145"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Teen Sleuths: The Secret of Dr. Gravely's Retreat
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260608T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260608T150000
UID:a9d8f2bca9b241b03c94cf88e7683743@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Summer Reading\, Teens\n\nYou and your friends are th
 e lucky winners of a free stay at the Foxcrest Retreat\, where the renowne
 d Dr. Gravely offers the latest and greatest spa treatments. However\, upo
 n your arrival\, you learn that all may not be what it seems at Foxcrest..
 .Can you escape the retreat before it's too late? Registration for Teen Sl
 euths: The Secret of Dr. Gravely's Retreat will open at 9:00AM on Wednesda
 y\, May 27th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Frida
 y\, May 29th for residents of other municipalities.For Teens ages 13-18 ye
 ars of age only.Only registrants will be allowed in the room.Library Progr
 am PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for mo
 re than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from registering 
 for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your
  registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow
  for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registrat
 ion status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start o
 f the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program wi
 ll begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be
  forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots r
 emain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants
  will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.
 Check In - All participants must provide an emergency contact number upon 
