 ’s Summer Reading Program is a community tradition that promotes reading
  for fun and lifelong enrichment. This summer\, we are offering a rich var
 iety of programs to spark curiosity\, imagination\, and learning across al
 l age groups.Join us for the ultimate building challenge! During this hand
 s-on workshop\, you will create your own bridge design using a variety of 
 materials\, engineering skills\, and teamwork.As we explore how bridges wo
 rk\, you'll learn about balance and shapes. You'll also get to test your b
 ridges to see how much weight they can hold and discover which designs are
  the strongest! This program is perfect for curious kids who love to build
  and want to learn how engineers design bridges in real life. Ages 7-12 ·
