X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Teen Video Gaming: Super Smash Bros
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260624T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260624T160000
UID:d43d5beba8319080220d67a22036c858@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Summer Reading\, Teens\n\nRegistration for Teen Video
  Gaming: Super Smash Bros. will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, June 10th fo
 r Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, June 12th f
 or residents of other municipalities.For Teens ages 13-18 years of age onl
 y.Only registrants will be allowed in the room.Get ready to brawl! Join us
  for an epic Super Smash Bros. Ultimate Tournament on the Nintendo Switch\
 , where teens battle it out for bragging rights and prizes. Whether you're
  a seasoned fighter or a casual button-masher\, this tournament is open to
  all skill levels. Come solo or bring your crew—only one will be crowned
  Smash Champion!We’ll kick things off with warm-up rounds\, then dive in
 to a bracket-style tournament with 1v1 matches on the big screen. Between 
 matches\, enjoy snacks\, cheer on your friends\, and hang out in a chill\,
  gamer-friendly space.Note: To help everyone stay present and get the most
  out of the experience\, we ask that all phones stay in pockets or bags du
 ring the program. Thank you for your cooperation!Library Program PoliciesN
 o Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 li
 brary programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future p
 rograms for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registratio
 ns at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those o
 n the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration status.L
 ate Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the progra
 m to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin pro
 mptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited t
 o those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, regi
 strants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be
  permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Check In - A
 ll participants must provide an emergency contact number upon registration
  or at the start of the program.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center C
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/teen-video-gaming-super-
 smash-bros-175094
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
