BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Amtshows": "https://amtshows.com/show/three-dog-night-2026/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:amtshows
X-SOURCE:American Music Theatre
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T200000
DTSTAMP:20260501T232111
CREATED:20260119T143003Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260115T174945Z
UID:10001850-1783108800-1783108800@amtshows.com
SUMMARY:Three Dog Night
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $49 $59 $69 $79\nAMT Member Pre-Sale: Wednesday\, January 21 at 10:00 a.m.\nPublic On-Sale: Friday\, January 23 at 10:00 a.m. \nLegendary band\, THREE DOG NIGHT\, now in its 6th decade\, claims some of the most astonishing statistics in popular music. In the years 1969 through 1974\, no other group achieved more top 10 hits\, moved more records\, or sold more concert tickets than THREE DOG NIGHT. \nTHREE DOG NIGHT hits weave through the fabric of pop culture today\, whether on the radio where they are heard day in and day out\, in TV commercials or in major motion pictures — songs like “Mama Told Me (Not To Come)”\, “Joy to the World”\, “Black and White”\, “Shambala” and “One” serve to heighten our emotions and crystallize THREE DOG NIGHT’s continuing popularity. \nBoasting chart and sales records that remain virtually unmatched in popular music\, THREE DOG NIGHT holds a Billboard Magazine record for releasing 21 consecutive Top 40 hits\, including 3 #1 singles “Mama Told Me (Not to Come)”\, “Joy to the World”\, and “Liar; the chart success drove 7 Platinum-selling singles and 12 straight RIAA Certified Gold LPs. The hits appeared on best-selling charts in all genres (pop\, rock\, rhythm & blues\, and country). Its records continue to sell around the world\, reaching beyond the borders of the U.S. into Japan\, Canada\, Holland\, England\, Germany\, Spain and elsewhere. Tens of millions of THREE DOG NIGHT records have been sold through the years. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/three-dog-night-2026/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://amtshows.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/TDN_Concessions-Events-and-News-for-Website-1920x1080-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
