UID:77e6a666baff5154b1178c76142245eb@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Summer Reading\, Teens\n\nYou and your friends have b
 een invited to a prestigious dinner with Boddy Black for a chance to discu
 ss personal business. Shortly into the feast\, Boddy tells you all that he
  intends to blackmail all of you. The power immediately cuts out. When the
  lights come back on\, Boddy is dead! It is now up to you and your guests 
 to determine the who\, what\, and where of Boddy's murder... before it is 
 too late.Registration for Teen Sleuths: Treachery at Tudor Mansion will op
 en at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, June 24th for Manheim Township and East Lampet
 er residents and on Friday\, June 26th for residents of other municipaliti
 es.For Teens ages 13-18 years of age only.Only registrants will be allowed
  in the room.Library Program PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel
  their registration for more than 2 library programs in a month will be re
 stricted from registering for future programs for a period of one month’
 s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the sta
 rt of the program to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of
  their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 mi
 nutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and other cir
 cumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At thi
 s time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be
  granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the prog
 ram. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 mi
 nutes past the start time.Check In - All participants must provide an emer
 gency contact number upon registration or at the start of the program.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Study Room #119
