BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Amtshows": "https://amtshows.com/show/aaron-lewis-and-the-stateliners/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:amtshows
X-SOURCE:American Music Theatre
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260716T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260716T193000
DTSTAMP:20260501T232111
CREATED:20260113T143056Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260116T145313Z
UID:10001846-1784230200-1784230200@amtshows.com
SUMMARY:Aaron Lewis and The Stateliners
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $79 $89 $99 $119\nAMT Member Pre-Sale: Wednesday\, January 14 at 9:00 a.m.\nPublic On-Sale: Friday\, January 16 at 10:00 a.m. \n  \nVIP1:  Aaron Lewis Side Stage Experience: $402 \n\nOne (1) Premium Reserved ticket in the first row\nExclusive Side Stage viewing opportunity for three songs.\nAutographed Setlist\nVIP Express lane – first entry at doors\nVIP Express lane – at designated merch stand\nExclusive VIP Merchandise\nLimited Edition Commemorative Laminate & Lanyard\n\nVIP 2: Aaron Lewis Early Entry + Merch Package $237 \n\nOne (1) Premium Reserved ticket (Rows 1-15)\nVIP Express lane – first entry at doors\nVIP Express lane – at designated merch stand\nExclusive VIP Merchandise\nLimited Edition Commemorative Laminate & Lanyard\n\nAaron Lewis\, the Vermont-born powerhouse first found success with Staind–the 2000s-era hard-rockers who injected meditative muscle into an era better known for mindless aggression. But while that band is still very much alive\, it was never enough to satisfy Lewis’ creative drive. \nEmbracing his roots to earn a rare second round of success\, a series of solo country projects have led to two No. 1 Billboard Country Album debuts–TOWN LINE (2011) and SINNER(2016)–plus a PLATINUM collab with heroes George Jones and Charlie Daniels (“Country Boy”)\, and a GOLD-certified Billboard No. 1 with “Am I The Only One” in 2021. Lewis’ 2022 solo album followed suit\, with FRAYED AT BOTH ENDS emerging as the best-selling Country album in America but he never wrote songs for the stats. No matter the sonic setting\, Lewis writes andsings to get his truth out and his latest album THE HILL(2024) is no different. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/aaron-lewis-and-the-stateliners/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://amtshows.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/AL_Concessions-Events-and-News-for-Website-1920x1080-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
