 at promotes reading for fun and lifelong enrichment. This summer\, we are 
 offering a rich variety of programs to spark curiosity\, imagination\, and
  learning across all age groups.Enjoy time with your child while building 
 a foundation for reading success. Featuring stories\, crafts\, and more!Pr
 eschoolers (ages 3-6) will enjoy this program the most\, but older and you
 nger siblings are invited to join in on the fun!Registration is helpful\, 
