DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, STEM\, Storytime\, Children\n\nJoin Mallory ou
 tside on the lawn under the tree for Stories in the Sunshine: Chalk Art an
 d Bubbles! We will start with a story\, a simple snack and then enjoy draw
 ing with chalk\, playing a game and enjoying bubbles! Bring a blanket or t
 owel to sit on and get ready for some fun in the sunshine! Ages 5-9.
