BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Amtshows": "https://amtshows.com/show/craig-morgan-2026/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:amtshows
X-SOURCE:American Music Theatre
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260807T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260807T200000
DTSTAMP:20260501T232111
CREATED:20260413T133042Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260415T131047Z
UID:10001876-1786132800-1786132800@amtshows.com
SUMMARY:Craig Morgan
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $49 $59 $69 $79\nAMT Member Pre-Sale: Wednesday\, April 15 at 10:00 a.m.\nPublic On-Sale: Friday\, April 17 at 10:00 a.m. \nKnown for his signature blend of heartfelt ballads and high-energy anthems\, Morgan has built a career rooted in real-life experiences\, patriotism\, and a deep connection to his fans. His chart-topping hits include “Redneck Yacht Club\,” “That’s What I Love About Sunday\,” “International Harvester\,” and “Almost Home\,” songs that capture the spirit of everyday life with honesty and heart. \nBefore his rise in country music\, Morgan proudly served in the U.S. Army\, a background that continues to shape both his music and his character. His dedication to service and community has earned him widespread respect\, including recognition from organizations supporting military members and veterans. \nOn stage\, Craig Morgan delivers a powerful live show filled with energy\, humor\, and genuine connection. Whether he’s sharing stories behind his songs or leading the crowd in a singalong\, his performances feel as personal as they are entertaining. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/craig-morgan-2026/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://amtshows.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/CM_Concessions-Events-and-News-for-Website-1920x1080-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
